fixture tech11_toss_teleport_and_air_dash_same_frame
doc Task 3 review round 2, M4: BUILD.md s5 Dash "Air dash: 1 per airtime"; s5 feel rules "acted on the same frame"; s6 Ember Toss "press again to teleport to it". Toss and dash pressed together in the air: the teleport goes first and the air dash goes from where it lands, so the dash is not spent on one the teleport ends the same frame.
room test/flat
spawn 400 544
frames 70
input
  0 U R toss
  30..43 jump
  44 -
  45 R toss dash
  46..60 R
end
expect
  at 44 state=air air_dashes=1
  at 45 event.teleport=1
  # Either the dash runs out of the teleport, or the air dash is still there.
  never 45..46 air_dashes=0 state!=dash
end
